                "description": "Baldwin Estate 5109 Lever with 5002 Rosette - Graceful in the way the handle gently spirals, this lever gives the illusion of a continuous line from tip to rose, exuding elegance without being gaudy. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden) for a very smooth look. It is available in 9 finishes. This leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
